    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player assumes the role of a Meow Star citizen who crash-lands on Shark Star, a planet composed entirely of floating islands, in a cardboard spaceship.  The kitty protagonist needs to live-stream what he sees and hears to the audience of the Meow Star while carrying out tasks assigned by the company, exploring the stories of these islands and the fallen giant Leviathan in this journey filled with wonderful ecological environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/68365ab0807ed5807f0c11520ebcd1c1.poster.avif?t=1754884507\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/68365ab0807ed5807f0c11520ebcd1c1.webm?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/68365ab0807ed5807f0c11520ebcd1c1.mp4?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun-driven exploration of floating islands</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/41a16ba74c57ccf651e92524a3732e18.poster.avif?t=1754884507\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/41a16ba74c57ccf651e92524a3732e18.webm?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/41a16ba74c57ccf651e92524a3732e18.mp4?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore by using the abilities of the possessed creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/5cee7ff67d92b8ca1d425d2bdb0561f6.poster.avif?t=1754884507\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/5cee7ff67d92b8ca1d425d2bdb0561f6.webm?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/5cee7ff67d92b8ca1d425d2bdb0561f6.mp4?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious and dynamic ocean world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/a4dd3a6e96f3009492f4fb385ad1c303.poster.avif?t=1754884507\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/a4dd3a6e96f3009492f4fb385ad1c303.webm?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/a4dd3a6e96f3009492f4fb385ad1c303.mp4?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for the hidden Leviathan passage on the islet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/875ae2939c4756f52eec5b8bcb797a77.poster.avif?t=1754884507\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850290/extras/875ae2939c4756f52eec5b8bcb797a77.webm?t=1754884507\" type=\"video/we